[03:00.36]address [əˈdres]vt. 处理，对付；写信给… n. 地址；演说 例 The reform efforts conducted by the banks failed to address the basic problem of the financial crisis. 搭 address oneself to... 致力于…派 addressee n. 收件人(例：complete addressee address 完 整的收件人地址) / addresser n. 发件人(例： addresser's signature 发件人的签字)
