[05:48.12]selected [sɪˈlektɪd]a. 精选的 搭 selected works 选集
[05:52.92]hike [haɪk]n. 提高，增加；涨价 vt. 提高，抬高(价 格)；涂改(支票) vi. (价格)上升 例 The government should look at a range of options, including a hike in electricity charges and longer holidays.
